 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGranite & Co Ltd                                              MASTER SERVICES\nUnit 7, Riverside Estate, BS1 5TR Bristol, United Kingdom              AGREEMENT\nVAT No: GB383957050\n\nFROM                                                         BILL TO\n\nGranite & Co Ltd                                             Albion Components Ltd\nUnit 7, Riverside Estate                                     221 Baker Street\nBS1 5TR Bristol                                              M1 2AB Manchester\nUnited Kingdom                                               United Kingdom\nVAT: GB383957050\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 05/05/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Granite & Co\nLtd, with its registered office at Unit 7, Riverside Estate, Bristol (\"Party A\"), and Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at 221\nBaker Street, Manchester (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Granite & Co Ltd / Oliver Bennett\nParty B      Albion Components Ltd / Harry Whitfield\nDate         05/05/2026",
